# Torpor Orb stops triggered abilities only. "This creature enters with X +1/+1 counters" is a replacement effect and
# "As this creature enters, choose a color" a static ability that works as it enters (CR 603.6d, 614.1c, 614.12): with
# the Orb out, Walking Ballista cast for X = 1 still enters with its counter, and Painter's Servant still has its color
# chosen (the rulings: "Replacement effects are unaffected ... Abilities that apply 'as [this creature] enters' ... are
# unaffected").

